###  https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/THH/-1
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/THH/-1> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :ValorDominio ;
                                                                         :esValorDeDominioDe <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/atributo/THH> ;
