                                                                        rdfs:label "Bajo"@es .


###  https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TLG/3
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TLG/3> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
