###  https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/og/041111
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/og/041111> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                             :ObjetoGeograficoCatalogado ;
                                                                    :defineClaseImplementable <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/feature/041111> ;
